OL,3,AKiller Christa Pike is to be executed
OL,4,Awithin days - but her defence say she's
OL,5,Aa victim too
OL,6,
OL,7,FSellars finds it hard to reconcile this
OL,8,Fwoman, whom she has only known to be
OL,9,Fkind and protective, with the person
OL,10,Fwho committed a heinous crime 31 years
OL,11,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
