OL,3,AFour killed in helicopter crash near
OL,4,AMontreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died after a
OL,7,Fhelicopter crashed in a small town 50km
OL,8,F(31 miles) from Montreal, Quebec's
OL,9,Fprovincial police have told the BBC.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FSainte-Brigide-d'Iberville shortly
OL,13,Fafter 14:30 local time (19:30 BST) on
OL,14,FSaturday afternoon, where they found
OL,15,Fthe aircraft on fire and declared its
OL,16,Foccupants dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe victims have not yet been
OL,19,Fidentified but the aircraft appeared to
OL,20,Fbe a private helicopter, Sergeant
OL,21,FAudrey-Anne Bilodeau said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
